WEBVTT

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:14.790
So did you encounter
the one who's killing the elders?

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:19.700
The one behind the killings is Krylancelo,
but at the same time, it's not.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:21.450
What do you mean by that?

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:25.750
The suspect looks just like how
Krylancelo looked five years ago.

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:29.830
Which is different from the one I saw,
who'd matured these past five years.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Don't come after me.

00:00:34.910 --> 00:00:38.910
So you're telling me there are two of them?

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:44.290
I have no idea who the suspect actually is
or why they took Krylancelo's form.

00:00:44.290 --> 00:00:47.500
How skilled is this other Krylancelo?

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:50.040
No one from this tower
could defeat him right now.

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:55.120
They're basically the ideal Successor
of the Razor's Edge that our master wanted.

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:57.500
The Successor of the Razor's Edge...

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:31.950
"Ghost from the Past"

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:44.000
Who are you?

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:46.290
I'm Krylancelo.

00:02:46.290 --> 00:02:49.120
And the only one of
Childman's students who was taught all

00:02:49.120 --> 00:02:54.660
of the fighting and assassination skills
by him since he was an assassin himself.

00:02:54.660 --> 00:03:01.040
You're not Krylancelo. There's no way
I could've killed anyone five years ago.

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:09.910
Which means I'm not you from five years ago.

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:13.450
I called myself Krylancelo up until five years ago.

00:03:13.450 --> 00:03:19.040
And you're the Krylancelo
that no one wanted, right?

00:03:19.040 --> 00:03:21.790
You were supposed to be
the Successor of the Razor's Edge,

00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:25.120
and you couldn't even kill anyone.

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:30.120
As soon as you left this place,
you were no longer me.

00:03:30.120 --> 00:03:32.410
I am the true Krylancelo.

00:03:32.410 --> 00:03:38.000
I'm the one they wanted. I live only for them.

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:39.330
Them?

00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:43.540
Yes. The only one that matters.

00:03:43.540 --> 00:03:45.700
You should know who that is.

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:52.750
Don't tell me...

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:55.750
Bye now.

00:03:56.580 --> 00:03:58.450
Wait!

00:04:20.790 --> 00:04:25.250
Leticia hasn't come back ever
since she went to the tower.

00:04:25.250 --> 00:04:28.040
And Master said he didn't want any breakfast.

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:32.910
There's so much I want to ask
him though... like about the tower.

00:04:32.910 --> 00:04:36.450
Not to mention who
the heck is this Krylancelo guy?

00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:42.370
I'm heading out for a bit.

00:04:42.370 --> 00:04:43.750
Where are you going?

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:48.660
To look for someone!

00:04:48.660 --> 00:04:51.080
Orphen seems down and out for some reason,

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:55.500
so this is a job for me, his trusty sidekick!

00:05:02.370 --> 00:05:06.580
Five years ago,
I left the tower to search for Azalie.

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:18.620
But I couldn't find any clues anywhere,

00:05:18.620 --> 00:05:21.160
so I ended up becoming an illegal moneylender.

00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:29.080
I... wanted to save her...

00:05:43.620 --> 00:05:46.870
I'm going to get my time back.

00:05:46.870 --> 00:05:50.700
Is this the time you wanted to get back, Azalie?

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:56.500
Having someone who looks
like me kill elders and rangers?

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:58.410
What exactly are you trying to do?

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:09.790
Unlike Black Sorcery
that affects things physically,

00:06:09.790 --> 00:06:12.500
White Sorcery affects things mentally.

00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:17.580
Don't forget! There's only one
way to counter White Sorcery.

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:21.870
And that's to have will power
that cannot be moved by others.

00:06:26.700 --> 00:06:28.450
Welcome back, Master.

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:30.120
Tifis, Pat.

00:06:30.120 --> 00:06:31.500
Hey, give her the thing.

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:33.750
Okay.

00:06:33.750 --> 00:06:35.120
Master...

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:37.580
Happy Birthday!

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:39.370
What?

00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:44.870
Thank you, Pat and Tifis.

00:06:47.790 --> 00:06:50.750
Perfect timing. Let me introduce you. He's Kry--

00:06:50.750 --> 00:06:53.200
A Sorcerer from the tower!

00:06:54.870 --> 00:06:58.370
Yes. He was in the same class I was.

00:06:58.370 --> 00:07:00.290
The Childman Class?

00:07:00.290 --> 00:07:02.660
These two are my students.

00:07:02.660 --> 00:07:06.500
This is Tifis, and his little sister, Patricia.

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:09.870
They're still trainees,
but they live in these dorms.

00:07:09.870 --> 00:07:12.450
So you're a teacher, eh?

00:07:13.580 --> 00:07:16.120
The name's Orphen. Nice to meet you.

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:17.080
Orphen?

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:22.870
Those two dwarves
aren't also Sorcerers, are they?

00:07:22.870 --> 00:07:25.000
Dwarves...?

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:28.370
They said they came here because
they saw you come into this mansion.

00:07:28.370 --> 00:07:32.000
Then they suddenly said they were hungry,
so we should feed them.

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:36.250
They weren't making any sense,
so we trapped them in the shed.

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:38.330
Pretty sure I can guess who they are.

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:45.250
How dare you trap us in here?!

00:07:45.250 --> 00:07:47.370
It's no use, Bro.

00:07:47.370 --> 00:07:50.000
Hey, open up! Open up, damn it!

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:55.330
Damn it! Damn it, damn it, damn it!

00:07:55.330 --> 00:07:57.540
M-Moneylender!

00:07:57.540 --> 00:07:59.500
We've been through hell because of you!

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:01.040
Please let us out of here.

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:03.200
You owe us, damn it!

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:08.660
You two were just trying to get a free meal.

00:08:08.660 --> 00:08:14.250
Don't worry. I'll set you two free.
In return, do some work for me.

00:08:14.250 --> 00:08:15.330
He's asking...

00:08:15.330 --> 00:08:17.450
...us for a favor?

00:08:22.160 --> 00:08:27.410
My birthday... Something
like this happened before, too.

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:32.790
"Everyone's Guardian Angel: Leticia MacCredy"

00:08:32.790 --> 00:08:35.950
"Everyone's Guardian Angel: Leticia MacCredy"

00:08:32.790 --> 00:08:35.950
I never mentioned to anyone that I liked angels.

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:37.580
I never mentioned to anyone that I liked angels.

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:40.950
Why isn't there a name on here?

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:45.620
Tish!

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:47.290
It's your birthday in two days, right?

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:48.000
It is.

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:51.040
Azalie and I would always celebrate with you.

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:54.830
Azalie had to go to the
royal capital on an errand.

00:08:54.830 --> 00:08:57.200
She won't be back at the tower until next week.

00:08:57.200 --> 00:09:00.000
I guess she's basically Master's secretary.

00:09:01.160 --> 00:09:03.660
What's that?

00:09:03.660 --> 00:09:08.910
Oh, this? It was in my mailbox yesterday.

00:09:08.910 --> 00:09:11.200
It must be a birthday present.

00:09:11.200 --> 00:09:13.500
Huh.

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:17.950
Do you remember our promise?
The one Azalie came up with.

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:22.700
If any of the three of us want to
spend our birthdays with someone else,

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:24.700
we'd come clean about it.

00:09:24.700 --> 00:09:27.500
Oh...

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:32.660
It's nothing like that.
I don't even know who gave this to me.

00:09:32.660 --> 00:09:36.500
I'm just wearing it because I like it.

00:09:36.500 --> 00:09:38.790
You're acting suspicious, Tish.

00:09:38.790 --> 00:09:41.200
Seriously, it's nothing like that.

00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:50.040
Heartia... He has naturally
impressive instincts,

00:09:50.040 --> 00:09:52.040
but he has trouble when it counts.

00:09:52.040 --> 00:09:55.790
He's Krylancelo's friend,
but always comes in second.

00:09:57.950 --> 00:09:59.700
Comicron...

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:01.540
He knows the ins and outs of the human body

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:03.750
and is an expert with Healing Sorcery.

00:10:03.750 --> 00:10:05.660
But other than that...

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:12.580
He's no match for his classmate, Corgon.

00:10:15.330 --> 00:10:17.000
Forte.

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:19.790
Using the technology of the Childman Network,

00:10:19.790 --> 00:10:23.120
he has endless connections and knowledge,

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:27.790
but when it comes to Sorcery,
he's inferior to Azalie and I.

00:10:27.790 --> 00:10:29.160
What's this training supposed to be?

00:10:29.160 --> 00:10:34.080
To put it simply...
A harsh dose of reality, maybe?

00:10:34.080 --> 00:10:35.910
This is the best the two of you can do?

00:10:35.910 --> 00:10:41.120
I guess I'm not surprised,
considering she's the best fighter we have.

00:10:41.120 --> 00:10:43.160
She was actually up against all three of us.

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:46.870
I got knocked back to this wall at the very start.

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:48.950
Did you need something?

00:10:48.950 --> 00:10:50.660
Want to join in if you're bored?

00:10:50.660 --> 00:10:55.750
I'm pretty sure I haven't
seen you move around for a while.

00:10:55.750 --> 00:11:01.040
I'll pass. I don't think I can have
you chip away at my confidence anymore.

00:11:01.040 --> 00:11:02.790
Master.

00:11:06.950 --> 00:11:10.370
Krylancelo, you have training
at my mansion in the afternoon.

00:11:10.370 --> 00:11:12.870
Y-Yes, sir.

00:11:14.160 --> 00:11:17.790
You're about the only one who gets
to train at Master's mansion, Krylancelo.

00:11:17.790 --> 00:11:20.500
Well, he is the Successor of the Razor's Edge.

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:25.120
Krylancelo... It's true that
he's precise, fast, and strong...

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:28.200
But he's still naïve.

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:31.700
Why is Krylancelo the Successor of the Razor's Edge?

00:11:39.200 --> 00:11:42.250
Your mood shifts like the mountain weather.

00:11:42.250 --> 00:11:43.750
What's that supposed to mean?

00:11:43.750 --> 00:11:47.290
I was just wondering why you're
in a bad mood all of a sudden.

00:11:47.290 --> 00:11:50.700
Didn't I ask you to not read my mind?

00:11:50.700 --> 00:11:54.160
You used to be cute.

00:11:54.160 --> 00:11:56.830
Did you really just say
that with a serious face?

00:11:56.830 --> 00:12:00.000
I already rejected you, remember?

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:03.000
My feelings for you haven't changed.

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:07.120
More importantly,
we need to talk about Krylancelo!

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:08.700
You saw him at training.

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:11.870
Azalie's completely spoiled him,
so he's totally off his guard.

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:16.370
Is that so? If you're not aware,
I should probably warn you...

00:12:16.370 --> 00:12:18.750
About what?

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:23.660
If he had tried any harder
during training, you would've died.

00:12:23.660 --> 00:12:24.790
What?

00:12:24.790 --> 00:12:26.750
That's how it's always been.

00:12:26.750 --> 00:12:30.450
His technique goes beyond your comprehension.

00:12:30.450 --> 00:12:33.620
You cannot stop him.

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:38.500
That's why he stops on his own. That's all.

00:12:42.950 --> 00:12:47.250
What did you want? Why'd you call me out here?

00:12:47.250 --> 00:12:49.160
Try it.

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:50.700
Try what?

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:53.000
Come at me like you're going to kill me.

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:56.450
What's the matter, Tish? You're acting weird.

00:12:56.450 --> 00:13:00.040
You might be right.
The angels might've spoken to me.

00:13:15.200 --> 00:13:18.660
Now that he mentioned it, I can see it.

00:13:18.660 --> 00:13:20.370
See what?

00:13:20.370 --> 00:13:24.080
You shifted your vital points right
as I was going to hit you.

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:28.620
I guess what Forte said was true.

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:29.660
Stand up.

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:32.290
I-I...

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:34.910
If you're going to dodge the next one,
you need to attack me first.

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:36.370
You're not going to be able to stop me

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:38.700
unless you come at me with everything you have.

00:13:40.580 --> 00:13:42.330
Tish...

00:13:42.330 --> 00:13:44.700
I want to see it...

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:47.700
Your true powers!

00:14:01.620 --> 00:14:03.910
When Krylancelo was serious,

00:14:03.910 --> 00:14:08.000
it was obvious that he was worthy of
being the Successor of the Razor's Edge.

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:12.750
Come in.

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:18.700
Tish, there's something I wanted to ask you.

00:14:20.580 --> 00:14:22.160
That's...

00:14:27.080 --> 00:14:30.500
"Tish, everyone's guardian angel."

00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:33.500
I think this is Comicron's handwriting.

00:14:34.120 --> 00:14:36.080
Comicron?

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:41.080
So Comicron...

00:14:43.750 --> 00:14:47.200
Everyone was watching you, Tish.

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:50.450
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:53.250
What are you two doing here?

00:14:53.250 --> 00:14:56.120
We're currently on the look out!

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:56.830
For what?

00:14:56.830 --> 00:14:57.750
An assassin!

00:14:57.750 --> 00:14:59.700
Wait. You guys, too?

00:14:59.700 --> 00:15:02.620
Orphen asked us to help him out.

00:15:02.620 --> 00:15:03.750
Orphen did?

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:05.660
Yeah! So get a clue!

00:15:05.660 --> 00:15:07.700
And feed us while you're at it!

00:15:07.700 --> 00:15:09.910
What's that supposed to mean?

00:15:09.910 --> 00:15:10.950
Let's start with the appetizer!

00:15:10.950 --> 00:15:12.370
Hey, my wallet!

00:15:13.500 --> 00:15:15.700
So what did you want to ask?

00:15:15.700 --> 00:15:20.370
Oh, well... It's about that assassin.

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:23.500
What do you think that Krylancelo's motive is?

00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:26.370
Most of the tower is out of commission right now.

00:15:26.370 --> 00:15:30.660
The only one actively functioning
is the Childman Class, isn't it?

00:15:30.660 --> 00:15:33.620
Correct, and it's just Forte and I.

00:15:33.620 --> 00:15:37.700
Comicron died two months ago in an accident.

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:43.040
Heartia is in Totokanta,
and I have no idea what Corgon's thinking.

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:44.870
And Azalie...

00:15:47.160 --> 00:15:50.450
More importantly, I have no idea
what Master Childman is doing.

00:15:50.450 --> 00:15:53.950
He disappeared over two months ago.

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:04.080
Stop!

00:16:08.910 --> 00:16:13.580
After Master Childman disappeared,
order was immediately lost at the tower,

00:16:13.580 --> 00:16:17.700
and the other classes
have been doing shady things.

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:20.660
There was poison in Forte's teacup.

00:16:22.370 --> 00:16:25.040
But he didn't bother reporting it.

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:29.870
He thought he could take control
of the tower if he handled it himself.

00:16:29.870 --> 00:16:33.540
Just like Master handled things.

00:16:33.540 --> 00:16:38.040
That other Krylancelo appeared
and started eliminating the elders

00:16:38.040 --> 00:16:41.450
that would get in the way
of the rise of the next Childman.

00:16:41.450 --> 00:16:45.950
The only two who could assassinate
anyone on the western side of the continent

00:16:45.950 --> 00:16:49.200
without being caught in Forte's Childman Network

00:16:49.200 --> 00:16:52.120
are Krylancelo... and Childman.

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:58.500
Well, in that case, Orphen,
who do you think is behind this?

00:16:58.500 --> 00:17:00.580
My little brother or my master?

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:05.250
Your brother left the tower a failure
because he wasn't able to kill anyone.

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:06.450
That really hasn't changed.

00:17:06.450 --> 00:17:09.080
So you're saying it's Master?!

00:17:09.080 --> 00:17:13.370
That's not possible, either.
Because he's not coming back.

00:17:13.370 --> 00:17:15.410
Do you know something?

00:17:21.660 --> 00:17:23.790
This club sandwich is delicious!

00:17:23.790 --> 00:17:25.870
Quit eating and start looking!

00:17:25.870 --> 00:17:27.450
Like you're one to talk!

00:17:39.580 --> 00:17:41.620
Followers of the Dragon Faiths...

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:44.000
Guess some are in this town, too.

00:17:48.040 --> 00:17:49.750
The assassin!

00:17:52.330 --> 00:17:54.160
Leki!

00:18:07.290 --> 00:18:10.660
Why won't you say anything now?!

00:18:10.660 --> 00:18:13.910
I've been waiting for you for five years!

00:18:13.910 --> 00:18:18.200
I knew you'd be back, so I prepared
a place we could all live together!

00:18:20.250 --> 00:18:27.040
I didn't doubt you came back
to this town to get revenge for Azalie.

00:18:27.040 --> 00:18:31.540
And if that was the case,
I was going to stop you,

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:38.450
but then Krylancelo from five years ago
was fighting you, who had matured.

00:18:38.450 --> 00:18:44.370
I probably can't take on
two members of the Childman Class.

00:18:44.370 --> 00:18:47.830
I will take Krylancelo.

00:18:47.830 --> 00:18:50.120
Don't come after me.

00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:56.450
For a moment, I actually thought
that my little brother, Krylancelo,

00:18:56.450 --> 00:18:59.790
became an assassin.

00:18:59.790 --> 00:19:04.410
The one you saw there was
the Krylancelo that the tower wanted.

00:19:04.410 --> 00:19:08.540
The ideal Krylancelo that Childman tried to raise.

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:13.040
Someone anyone could see as
the Successor of the Razor's Edge.

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:14.870
Master!

00:19:14.870 --> 00:19:16.750
Apparently Claiomh was kidnapped!

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:18.000
What?!

00:19:18.000 --> 00:19:19.750
It all happened so fast!

00:19:19.750 --> 00:19:21.750
An assassin popped out of nowhere!

00:19:21.750 --> 00:19:23.370
The hell were you guys doing?!

00:19:23.370 --> 00:19:26.790
You only asked us to find the assassin!

00:19:26.790 --> 00:19:30.200
We at least saw him go into
that whatever-man's mansion!

00:19:30.200 --> 00:19:33.790
Whatever-man? You mean Childman's place?

00:19:33.790 --> 00:19:37.250
Who is this assassin named Krylancelo?

00:19:37.250 --> 00:19:40.910
Krylancelo is a Sorcerer who climbed
the ranks of the Tower of Fangs five years ago

00:19:40.910 --> 00:19:43.950
and was about to be chosen
as one of the Thirteen Apostles.

00:19:43.950 --> 00:19:47.080
The Thirteen Apostles?
You mean the court Sorcerers?

00:19:47.080 --> 00:19:51.540
Yes. He was going to be the
successor to our master, Childman,

00:19:51.540 --> 00:19:54.000
and was also called the Successor of the Razor's Edge.

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:56.950
Someone that amazing is that assassin?

00:19:56.950 --> 00:20:01.160
Yes. And that's also Orphen's former form.

00:20:01.160 --> 00:20:03.620
Huh? Master's?

00:20:03.620 --> 00:20:07.660
That assassin is Krylancelo from five years ago.

00:20:07.660 --> 00:20:10.580
On top of that, he's definitely
stronger than Orphen is right now.

00:20:10.580 --> 00:20:14.160
He's trying to lure me out.

00:20:14.160 --> 00:20:15.790
Master, I'll go with you!

00:20:15.790 --> 00:20:18.330
You're just going to be in the way if you go.

00:20:18.330 --> 00:20:22.160
So what?! I'm Master's student!

00:20:22.160 --> 00:20:23.330
As his student--

00:20:23.330 --> 00:20:24.500
Stop that.

00:20:24.500 --> 00:20:28.500
Well, do you think Master could
defeat someone like that on his own?

00:20:28.500 --> 00:20:30.160
Of course, Orphen can't.

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:34.160
Then I should go and assist Master!

00:20:34.160 --> 00:20:36.330
Would you two just shut up?!

00:20:36.330 --> 00:20:39.040
That's enough!

00:20:39.040 --> 00:20:43.750
I'll go with you, too!
You're facing that assassin, right?

00:20:46.040 --> 00:20:48.700
An assassin... or Stabber.

00:20:48.700 --> 00:20:53.450
A Black Sorcerer that trained at
the tower to become an assassin...

00:20:53.450 --> 00:20:57.370
Do you think that Claiomh died, Master?

00:20:57.370 --> 00:21:04.410
Nah. I'm sure he realizes he wouldn't
be able to control me if he killed Claiomh.

00:21:04.410 --> 00:21:07.000
This is his way of luring me out.

00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:10.040
He won't kill her because of that.

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:14.500
Master... What's Krylancelo's goal?

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:17.040
Why did Krylancelo appear now?

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:20.200
Why'd he appear now, huh?

00:21:22.370 --> 00:21:28.700
All kinds of things are happening
right now, and he appeared.

00:21:28.700 --> 00:21:33.200
Tish is still complaining, and I'm still unsure.

00:21:33.200 --> 00:21:35.000
Unsure?

00:21:35.000 --> 00:21:37.540
I'm unsure if the guy who showed up is the real me

00:21:37.540 --> 00:21:41.450
or if I'm the real me.

00:21:41.450 --> 00:21:46.410
But it's actually probably him...
The true Krylancelo that is.

00:21:48.450 --> 00:21:50.250
I'll bring Claiomh back.

00:21:50.250 --> 00:21:55.370
And then I'll also put an end to all
the things you don't know about me, too.

00:23:38.080 --> 00:23:43.080
Master had always said that
the three goddesses would never meet.

00:23:43.080 --> 00:23:45.000
The three goddesses
of Past, Present, and Future.

00:23:45.000 --> 00:23:47.000
"Make My Past Disappear, Assassin"

00:23:45.000 --> 00:23:47.000
The three goddesses
of Past, Present, and Future.
